# Kept out of the published registry archive. Gitignore syntax.
#
# The pack itself is well under a megabyte. Everything below is research
# material - recorded sessions used to derive the numbers quoted in the README.
# It stays in the repo for anyone who wants to check the working, but shipping
# it to every Manager install would make the download ~300x bigger for no
# benefit. The analysis scripts themselves are still included, so a clone is
# only needed to re-run them against your own captures.
analysis/memxray_runs.db
analysis/raw/

# docs/ is deliberately NOT excluded: it is only ~60 KB of screenshots, and the
# registry renders this README on the node's public page - dropping them would
# leave broken images there.

# Session handoff notes - development bookkeeping, not part of the pack.
HANDOFF.md
